    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an intergalactic battle like no other! In this <strong>fast-paced space shooter with bullet hell action</strong>, you\u2019ll face waves of <strong>adorable yet deadly mutant fruits</strong> threatening to destroy the universe. Only the most skilled players can dodge the chaos, shoot relentlessly, and uncover the dark truth behind the invasion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Intense Action</strong> \u2013 Shoot and dodge at high speed in a challenge where every second matters.<br>\ud83c\udf49 <strong>Unique Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 Each boss offers a different fight that will test your reflexes and strategy.<br>\ud83c\udf0c <strong>A Story with a Twist</strong> \u2013 Discover who's behind the chaos and prepare for a shocking revelation.<br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Hardcore Difficulty</strong> \u2013 If you love tough games and bullet hell challenges, this is your ultimate test.<br>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Tight Controls</strong> \u2013 Master the art of dodging and shooting with smooth and addictive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the mutant fruit invasion and save the universe? \ud83c\udf20\ud83d\udd25<br><br>In <i>Fruitgeddon</i>, you don\u2019t just survive the chaos \u2013 you shape it! Customize your weapons to match your playstyle: modify your shot type, adjust your firing angle, and create unique combinations to unleash maximum power against your enemies. In this world of fruity destruction, you decide how to fight. Do you prefer a barrage of projectiles or a precise, deadly shot? The choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593020/extras/a5d4af12ab19c4b5647a8580fcff89e4.poster.avif?t=1752812162\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593020/extras/a5d4af12ab19c4b5647a8580fcff89e4.webm?t=1752812162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593020/extras/a5d4af12ab19c4b5647a8580fcff89e4.mp4?t=1752812162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an intergalactic battle like no other! In this <strong>fast-paced space shooter with bullet hell action</strong>, you\u2019ll face waves of <strong>adorable yet deadly mutant fruits</strong> threatening to destroy the universe. Only the most skilled players can dodge the chaos, shoot relentlessly, and uncover the dark truth behind the invasion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Intense Action</strong> \u2013 Shoot and dodge at high speed in a challenge where every second matters.<br>\ud83c\udf49 <strong>Unique Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 Each boss offers a different fight that will test your reflexes and strategy.<br>\ud83c\udf0c <strong>A Story with a Twist</strong> \u2013 Discover who's behind the chaos and prepare for a shocking revelation.<br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Hardcore Difficulty</strong> \u2013 If you love tough games and bullet hell challenges, this is your ultimate test.<br>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Tight Controls</strong> \u2013 Master the art of dodging and shooting with smooth and addictive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the mutant fruit invasion and save the universe? \ud83c\udf20\ud83d\udd25<br><br>In <i>Fruitgeddon</i>, you don\u2019t just survive the chaos \u2013 you shape it! Customize your weapons to match your playstyle: modify your shot type, adjust your firing angle, and create unique combinations to unleash maximum power against your enemies. In this world of fruity destruction, you decide how to fight. Do you prefer a barrage of projectiles or a precise, deadly shot? The choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593020/extras/a5d4af12ab19c4b5647a8580fcff89e4.poster.avif?t=1752812162\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593020/extras/a5d4af12ab19c4b5647a8580fcff89e4.webm?t=1752812162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593020/extras/a5d4af12ab19c4b5647a8580fcff89e4.mp4?t=1752812162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
